{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Artin–Wedderburn定理"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"title":[{"Plain":"Artin–Wedderburn 定理"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"半单环","text":"半单环"}},{"Plain":" $R$ 是有限个除环上的矩阵代数的积:\n$$\r\nR \\simeq \\prod_{i=1}^n M_{n_i}(D_i).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>证明</h2>\n<p>将 $R$ 视为自身上的"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数上的模","text":"模"}},{"Plain":", 分解为单模:\n$$\r\nR \\simeq \\bigoplus X_i^{n_i}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>由 "},{"Local":{"url":"Schur引理","text":"Schur 引理"}},{"Plain":",\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{End}(R)\\simeq \\prod_{i=1}^n M_{n_i}(\\operatorname{End}(X_i)),\r\n$$\n其中 $\\operatorname{End}(X_i)$ 为除环.</p>\n<p>最后, $R$ 作为模的自同态环同构于环 $R$:\n$$\r\nR\\simeq \\operatorname{End}(R).\r\n$$\n结论得证.</p>\n"}]}}